  "body": "Adds missing attributes to [index of elements](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/indices.html#elements-3).\n- [nomodule](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#attr-script-nomodule) is added to [script](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#the-script-element)\n- [autocomplete](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#attr-fe-autocomplete) is added to [textarea](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#the-textarea-element)\n- [dir](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#attr-dir) is added to [bdo](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/text-level-semantics.html#the-bdo-element). It is a global attribute, but with a special meaning in bdo element, so I am not sure if you want it.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8381/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 13, 2022, 9:53 AM UTC (5753d78)\">/indices.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8381/ed280ec...5753d78/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 13, 2022, 9:53 AM UTC (5753d78)\">diff</a> )",
